{
 "hub": "<main data-view=\"careers\" data-title=\"Careers | Ferrous Group\"><section class=\"cr-hero\"><div class=\"heat\"></div><div class=\"grid-bg\"></div><div class=\"wrap\"><a class=\"back ia\" href=\"/\">&larr; Ferrous Group</a><div class=\"lab ia\" style=\"animation-delay:.1s\"><span class=\"idx\">»</span> Careers</div><h1 class=\"ia\" style=\"animation-delay:.18s\">Build What India’s <br/>Industry <span class=\"red-word\">Runs <span class=\"red-word\">On.</span></span></h1><p class=\"lede ia\" style=\"animation-delay:.28s\">Forty years of heavy engineering out of Central India. We manufacture and restore the critical components inside the country’s largest power, cement, steel and defence plants. If you want work with real weight behind it, this is the place.</p><div class=\"k-tiles ia\" style=\"animation-delay:.38s\"><div class=\"kt acc\"><small>Open Roles</small><b>{{N}}</b></div><div class=\"kt\"><small>Companies</small><b>Three</b></div><div class=\"kt\"><small>Locations</small><b>Chandrapur & Pune</b></div><div class=\"kt\"><small>Established</small><b>1985</b></div></div><div class=\"acts ia\" style=\"animation-delay:.48s\"><a class=\"btn btn-p\" href=\"#openings\">See Open Roles <span class=\"ar\">&rarr;</span></a><a class=\"btn btn-s\" href=\"#general\">Send Us Your CV</a></div></div></section><section class=\"k-sec\" id=\"openings\" data-sheet=\"Openings\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hd\"><div><div class=\"lab rv\"><span class=\"idx\">01</span> Open Positions</div><h2 class=\"h2\" data-split>Where You <span class=\"red-word\">Fit In.</span></h2></div><p class=\"lede rv\" style=\"--d:140ms\">Every role below is live right now. Apply online in one form, or walk in to the plant and talk to us directly.</p></div>{{JOBS}}</div></div></section><section class=\"k-sec\" id=\"why\" data-sheet=\"Why Ferrous\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hd\"><div><div class=\"lab rv\"><span class=\"idx\">02</span> Why Ferrous</div><h2 class=\"h2\" data-split>What You Get <br/>Working <span class=\"red-word\">Here.</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"k-edges four\"><div class=\"k-edge rv\" style=\"--d:0ms\"><div class=\"n\">01</div><h4>Machines That Matter</h4><p>A 3.5 m vertical lathe, a 3 × 13 m CNC plasma bed, a 500 MT press. Equipment most workshops in India will never touch.</p></div><div class=\"k-edge rv\" style=\"--d:110ms\"><div class=\"n\">02</div><h4>Work You Can Point At</h4><p>Components running inside NTPC, Adani, SAIL and Ordnance Factory plants. Real output, not slide decks.</p></div><div class=\"k-edge rv\" style=\"--d:220ms\"><div class=\"n\">03</div><h4>A Small Team, Real Ownership</h4><p>You will not be a row in a spreadsheet. Your work is visible, and so is the difference you make to it.</p></div><div class=\"k-edge rv\" style=\"--d:330ms\"><div class=\"n\">04</div><h4>Forty Years Of Stability</h4><p>Founded 1985, three companies, 2,00,000+ sq. ft. and clients who have come back for decades.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"k-sec\" id=\"general\" data-sheet=\"General Application\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hd\"><div><div class=\"lab rv\"><span class=\"idx\">03</span> General Application</div><h2 class=\"h2\" data-split>Nothing Fits? <br/>Send It <span class=\"red-word\">Anyway.</span></h2></div><p class=\"lede rv\" style=\"--d:140ms\">We keep strong profiles on file. If none of the roles above match what you do, tell us what you are good at and we will reach out when something opens.</p></div><div class=\"fshell rv\"><div class=\"fs-load\"><span class=\"spin\"></span>Loading form</div><iframe data-tally-src=\"https://tally.so/embed/KYbWpg?source=careers-general&hideTitle=1&dynamicHeight=1\" loading=\"lazy\" title=\"General application form\"></iframe></div><p class=\"fnote\">Form not loading? Email your CV to <a href=\"mailto:careers@ferrous.co.in\">careers@ferrous.co.in</a>.</p></div></section><section class=\"sec nx\" data-sheet=\"Where To Next\"><div class=\"heat two\"></div><div class=\"wrap\">\n <div class=\"hd\"><div><div class=\"lab rv\"><span class=\"idx\">»</span> Keep Exploring</div><h2 class=\"h2\" data-split>Where To <span class=\"red-word\">Next?</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"nxg\"><a class=\"nn rv\" style=\"--d:0ms\" href=\"/\">\n <div class=\"k\">The Group<i>01</i></div><div class=\"lg\"><img data-a=\"word\" class=\"lgw\" alt=\"Ferrous Group\"></div><div class=\"d\">40+ years of engineering excellence. Three companies, one standard.</div>\n <span class=\"enter\">Back to the Group<span class=\"o\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></span></a><a class=\"nn rv\" style=\"--d:80ms\" href=\"/fe\">\n <div class=\"k\">Cement &amp; Steel<i>02</i></div><div class=\"lg\"><img data-a=\"lfe\" class=\"\" alt=\"Ferrous Engineering\"></div><div class=\"d\">Heavy fabrication, precision machining &amp; the RAL specialists.</div>\n <span class=\"enter\">Enter Ferrous Engineering<span class=\"o\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></span></a><a class=\"nn rv\" style=\"--d:160ms\" href=\"/de\">\n <div class=\"k\">Power &amp; Defence<i>03</i></div><div class=\"lg\"><img data-a=\"lde\" class=\"\" alt=\"Deepak Engineering\"></div><div class=\"d\">Critical spares: built new, developed &amp; restored beyond new.</div>\n <span class=\"enter\">Enter Deepak Engineering<span class=\"o\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></span></a><a class=\"nn rv\" style=\"--d:240ms\" href=\"/fapl\">\n <div class=\"k\">Automation<i>04</i></div><div class=\"lg\"><img data-a=\"lfa\" class=\"\" alt=\"Ferrous Automations\"></div><div class=\"d\">Telescopic belt conveyors &amp; material handling automation.</div>\n <span class=\"enter\">Enter Ferrous Automations<span class=\"o\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></span></a></div></div></section></main>",
 "apply_head": "<div class=\"hd\"><div><div class=\"lab rv\"><span class=\"idx\">»</span> Apply</div><h2 class=\"h2\" data-split>Apply For <br/>This <span class=\"red-word\">Role.</span></h2></div><p class=\"lede rv\" style=\"--d:140ms\">Fill out this form to apply to {{TITLE}}. Make sure you read the job description before applying, and be specific while answering questions. Generic submissions will be filtered out.</p></div>",
