 "walk_head": "<div class=\"hd\"><div><div class=\"lab rv\"><span class=\"idx\">»</span> Walk-In</div><h2 class=\"h2\" data-split>Or Just <span class=\"red-word\">Turn Up.</span></h2></div><p class=\"lede rv\" style=\"--d:140ms\">We interview walk-in candidates at the plant. No appointment needed. Bring a printed CV and any certificates you have.</p></div>",
